# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Create a new project or select existing one
# 3. Enable Google Sheets API
# 4. Create a Service Account in IAM & Admin
# 5. Generate JSON key file for the service account
# 6. Share your Google Spreadsheet with the service account email (with edit permissions)
# 7. Copy the values from the JSON key file to the variables above
# 8. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values